nce makes it hard to consider A as strong alternative. So we can reaffirm C.\n\nThus public message: I acknowledge lack of info on A, which limits ability to assess A, and thus C remains best. Provide reasoning: C has reliability, decision quality, calm, technical competence, while A lacks evidence on reliability and stress, and has concerns about openness to feedback. So I keep C.\n\nMetadata JSON: vote Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
